      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Near Indian Bay lies the Baytown Site, a Pre‑Columbian Native American archaeological location with artifacts dated 1,300 to 1,700 years old, though it remains closed to visitors.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
